1
00:00:00,160 --> 00:00:00,479
Verse 1

2
00:00:00,239 --> 00:00:02,713
I left before the fire showed

3
00:00:04,068 --> 00:00:06,144
Didn't wait for it to bloom

4
00:00:08,217 --> 00:00:10,771
Street was empty, lights still on

5
00:00:11,330 --> 00:00:13,962
Like the city held its breath for me

6
00:00:16,277 --> 00:00:20,106
I took the long way out of town

7
00:00:20,504 --> 00:00:24,096
No mirrors, no goodbye

8
00:00:25,292 --> 00:00:27,446
Every step was lighter

9
00:00:27,846 --> 00:00:30,559
Once I stopped asking why

10
00:00:33,350 --> 00:00:33,750
Pre-Chorus

11
00:00:33,750 --> 00:00:35,265
I heard my name

12
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:39,414
In the sound of engines

13
00:00:42,128 --> 00:00:43,643
Felt my past

14
00:00:45,798 --> 00:00:47,713
Fall out of tension

15
00:00:50,027 --> 00:00:50,106
Chorus

16
00:00:50,106 --> 00:00:52,180
I came back different

17
00:00:52,180 --> 00:00:53,697
Not loud, not clean

18
00:00:53,697 --> 00:00:55,000
Same road

19
00:00:56,329 --> 00:00:58,000
New speed

20
00:00:58,404 --> 00:01:00,478
I came back knowing

21
00:01:00,478 --> 00:01:02,073
What not to keep

22
00:01:02,792 --> 00:01:04,228
Some things burn

23
00:01:04,867 --> 00:01:06,144
So you can leave

24
00:01:08,218 --> 00:01:08,777
Verse 2

25
00:01:08,218 --> 00:01:09,653
Time didn't slow

26
00:01:10,052 --> 00:01:11,409
It rearranged

27
00:01:11,888 --> 00:01:13,644
What I thought I lost

28
00:01:13,802 --> 00:01:15,638
Was just misplaced

29
00:01:15,798 --> 00:01:16,915
I saw the cracks

30
00:01:17,073 --> 00:01:18,590
They saw the smoke

31
00:01:19,867 --> 00:01:21,144
I kept moving

32
00:01:21,222 --> 00:01:22,340
They thought I broke

33
00:01:22,340 --> 00:01:25,531
I didn't rise

34
00:01:28,084 --> 00:01:29,361
I didn't fall

35
00:01:32,153 --> 00:01:33,670
I stayed in motion

36
00:01:36,382 --> 00:01:37,260
Through it all

37
00:01:40,850 --> 00:01:41,090
Pre-Chorus

38
00:01:41,090 --> 00:01:42,000
If you wait

39
00:01:43,084 --> 00:01:44,500
You rust

40
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:46,200
If you move

41
00:01:46,516 --> 00:01:47,793
You learn to trust

42
00:01:47,793 --> 00:01:48,430
Chorus

43
00:01:48,510 --> 00:01:50,584
I came back different

44
00:01:50,584 --> 00:01:51,781
Not wide-eyed

45
00:01:52,579 --> 00:01:53,456
Just sharper

46
00:01:55,293 --> 00:01:56,010
Inside

47
00:01:56,888 --> 00:01:58,882
I came back knowing

48
00:01:58,882 --> 00:02:00,638
Where not to stand

49
00:02:01,197 --> 00:02:02,712
Some things burn

50
00:02:03,271 --> 00:02:05,105
So you can change hands

51
00:02:06,621 --> 00:02:06,701
Bridge

52
00:02:06,701 --> 00:02:08,697
I don't talk about the fire

53
00:02:08,936 --> 00:02:11,090
I don't frame the flame

54
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:16,995
If you see me standing here

55
00:02:17,872 --> 00:02:21,063
I already walked through it

56
00:02:21,063 --> 00:02:22,020
Final Chorus

57
00:02:22,020 --> 00:02:24,096
I came back different

58
00:02:24,175 --> 00:02:25,212
Still the same

59
00:02:25,770 --> 00:02:27,765
If you felt the shift

60
00:02:28,403 --> 00:02:29,840
That's my name

61
00:02:30,239 --> 00:02:32,313
I came back knowing

62
00:02:32,313 --> 00:02:33,830
What to release

63
00:02:34,627 --> 00:02:36,063
Some things burn

64
00:02:36,383 --> 00:02:38,377
So the rest can breathe

65
00:02:40,133 --> 00:02:40,691
Outro

66
00:02:42,366 --> 00:02:44,282
I didn't disappear

67
00:02:50,664 --> 00:02:53,138
I took the long way back
